================ T3 result ================
Phase 2 fallbacks: 894 on every one of the six runs, both architectures.
The two sieves agree in the regime the ladder measures. Correctness question
closed: the timing difference between the builds is code generation.

Timings (s). The ~0.13 s setup floor measured in bench-logs-v201/setup_cost.log
dominates at this size, so these bound the per-work ratio only loosely:
  sm_120 : 0.410942 (cold), 0.193306, 0.182212
  sm_75  : 0.179448, 0.170709, 0.178768
The 1.9x seen at 10^10 does not reproduce here even with the full base-prime
list, so it is a function of total sieve work, not of the list size alone.
